{{ remediation or "1. Validate and sanitize all URI paths using `Uri.getLastPathSegment()` and canonicalization\n2. Use parameterized queries instead of string concatenation\n3. Set `android:exported=\"false\"` if the provider doesn't need external access\n4. Implement proper permission checks with `android:permission` attribute" }}
